                <pb facs="0851" n="747" sameAs="frus:frus1932v03/pg747"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/5144: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China (Johnson) to the Acting
                        Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1932-05-03T12:00:00+08:00">May 3, 1932—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received
                        May 3—3 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Quo Tai-chi, chief delegate on Chinese side assaulted by Chinese student at his
                    house at about 9:30 this morning. Slightly wounded on forehead. It is not
                    believed that his condition is such as to delay proceedings.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Johnson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
